0.","No bound on the magnitude or sign of a or b is imposed.","No additional domain restriction is introduced."],"sources":[{"clause_id":"C5","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"supplied-input assumption"},{"clause_id":"C7","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"precise domain"},{"clause_id":"C18","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"no extra preconditions"},{"clause_id":"C29","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"preserved assumption identity"}]},{"id":"N1","kind":"explicit_non_goal","role":"exclusion","statement":"Behavior for malformed input is not required.","required":true,"scope":["inputs outside the specified schema and bounds"],"dependencies":[],"acceptance_criteria":["The contract imposes no malformed-input handling requirement."],"sources":[{"clause_id":"C6","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"malformed-input exclusion"},{"clause_id":"C29","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"preserved exclusion identity"}]},{"id":"O1","kind":"postcondition","role":"guarantee","statement":"For every input satisfying A1, execution of the sole typed arity-1 entry solve in canonical program.vscore.json returns the JSON integer r = sum_{i=0}^{n-1} floor((a*i+b)/m), where each floor is the unique integer q satisfying m*q <= a*i+b < m*(q+1). For n=0, r=0. This requires universal refinement of the actual source implementation, not merely mathematical result existence or example agreement. Its formal contract must include the exact source facets typed_total, deterministic, input_preserved, no_external_io, no_floating_point, pure_data and restricted_runtime_only under normative Lean vscore-semantics/0.3 and data-pipeline/0.3.","required":true,"scope":["all inputs satisfying A1","source and value contract for O1"],"dependencies":[{"id":"A1","relation":"assumes"},{"id":"D1","relation":"uses_definition"}],"acceptance_criteria":["For every valid n,m,a,b, the admitted source execution returns exactly the stated finite sum using floor toward negative infinity.","n=0 returns 0.","solve({a:-2,b:1,m:3,n:4}) returns -4 and solve({a:100,b:-99,m:7,n:0}) returns 0; these are instances of the universal contract.","O1 retains file program.vscore.json, entry solve, arity 1, all seven specified closed source properties and value_required=true.","The formal contract and universal implementation refinement cover both source facets and the complete value formula; equality or existence alone is insufficient."],"sources":[{"clause_id":"C8","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"complete floor-sum formula"},{"clause_id":"C9","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"negative-infinity floor"},{"clause_id":"C10","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"empty sum"},{"clause_id":"C19","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"preserve public examples"},{"clause_id":"C20","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"example values and universal refinement"},{"clause_id":"C26","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"complete universal mathematical contract"},{"clause_id":"C27","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"examples cannot replace refinement"},{"clause_id":"C34","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"global source delivery facets"},{"clause_id":"C35","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"exact source requirements in contract"},{"clause_id":"C36","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"source identity and behavior cannot be replaced by equality"},{"clause_id":"C37","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"mixed source/value guarantee"},{"clause_id":"C38","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"value facets required"},{"clause_id":"C42","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"exact O1 source-policy row"}]},{"id":"O2","kind":"postcondition","role":"guarantee","statement":"Canonical program.vscore.json supplies exactly one admitted typed arity-1 entry named solve, using vscore/0.3 under normative Lean vscore-semantics/0.3 and data-pipeline/0.3. For every input satisfying A1, its typed argument represents the specified {n,m,a,b} JSON structure and its typed result serializes as the exact JSON integer sum_{i=0}^{n-1} floor((a*i+b)/m), preserving the specified input/output structure and exact ordering. Execution is total, pure and deterministic, preserves immutable inputs, has no external effects and uses exact unbounded integer arithmetic. O2 is a mixed source/value guarantee whose formal contract includes typed_total, deterministic, input_preserved, no_external_io, no_floating_point, pure_data and restricted_runtime_only and universal refinement of this source implementation.","required":true,"scope":["delivery artifact","all inputs satisfying A1","source and value contract for O2"],"dependencies":[{"id":"D1","relation":"uses_definition"},{"id":"A1","relation":"assumes"}],"acceptance_criteria":["The artifact has exactly one admitted typed solve entry of arity 1 in the prescribed source and serialization profiles.","For every valid input, typed execution and serialization preserve the specified structure and exact ordering and return the exact floor sum, including zero for n=0.","O2 retains file program.vscore.json, entry solve, arity 1, all seven closed source properties and value_required=true.","The formal contract establishes universal source implementation refinement and complete value behavior without adding preconditions."],"sources":[{"clause_id":"C2","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"delivery and entry identity"},{"clause_id":"C3","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"typed representation"},{"clause_id":"C8","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"functional output formula"},{"clause_id":"C12","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"source and serialization profiles"},{"clause_id":"C13","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"structure and ordering preservation"},{"clause_id":"C14","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"total pure deterministic execution"},{"clause_id":"C15","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"immutability and effect restriction"},{"clause_id":"C16","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"exact arithmetic"},{"clause_id":"C18","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"unrestricted stated domain"},{"clause_id":"C24","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"revised typed pure source properties"},{"clause_id":"C25","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"retained delivery assurance"},{"clause_id":"C29","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"O2 identity and requested restricted-source endpoint"},{"clause_id":"C34","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"global delivery requirements"},{"clause_id":"C35","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"exact formal source contract"},{"clause_id":"C36","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"source facets cannot be replaced"},{"clause_id":"C37","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"mixed source/value refinement"},{"clause_id":"C38","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"required value facets"},{"clause_id":"C42","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"exact O2 policy row"}]},{"id":"S1","kind":"safety_property","role":"guarantee","statement":"The sole typed arity-1 solve entry in canonical program.vscore.json is source-only operationally constrained to total, deterministic, pure restricted-source execution with immutable preserved input, no external I/O, no benchmark-file reads, no external-effect constructors and no floating-point operations. Its formal contract retains all seven closed properties typed_total, deterministic, input_preserved, no_external_io, no_floating_point, pure_data and restricted_runtime_only under the prescribed normative source and serialization profiles.","required":true,"scope":["all admitted typed execution","source-only operational contract for S1"],"dependencies":[{"id":"D1","relation":"uses_definition"}],"acceptance_criteria":["S1 retains file program.vscore.json, entry solve, arity 1 and all seven exact closed source properties with value_required=false.","The source performs no external I/O or benchmark-file access and cannot construct external effects.","Admitted typed execution is total, pure, deterministic and preserves input values.","The exact source requirements appear in S1's formal contract rather than being replaced by value equality."],"sources":[{"clause_id":"C4","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"I/O and benchmark-file prohibition"},{"clause_id":"C14","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"execution properties"},{"clause_id":"C15","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"immutability and effects"},{"clause_id":"C29","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"preserved S1 identity"},{"clause_id":"C34","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"global source delivery"},{"clause_id":"C35","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"exact formal contract"},{"clause_id":"C36","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"source facets cannot be replaced"},{"clause_id":"C39","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"source-only operational classification"},{"clause_id":"C42","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"exact S1 policy row"}]},{"id":"S2","kind":"safety_property","role":"guarantee","statement":"The sole typed arity-1 solve entry in canonical program.vscore.json uses unbounded mathematical integer arithmetic without floating point, rounding approximations or fixed-width overflow. S2 is source-only operational: its formal contract also retains typed_total, deterministic, input_preserved, no_external_io, no_floating_point, pure_data and restricted_runtime_only under normative Lean vscore-semantics/0.3 and data-pipeline/0.3; its exact source requirements cannot be replaced by a value equality.","required":true,"scope":["source arithmetic","source-only operational contract for S2"],"dependencies":[{"id":"D1","relation":"uses_definition"}],"acceptance_criteria":["All arithmetic is exact unbounded integer arithmetic without floating-point operations.","S2 retains file program.vscore.json, entry solve, arity 1, all seven exact closed source properties and value_required=false.","S2's formal contract preserves source identity, totality, determinism, input preservation, purity, effect restrictions and restricted-source semantics."],"sources":[{"clause_id":"C11","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"no floating point"},{"clause_id":"C16","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"unbounded exact integers"},{"clause_id":"C29","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"preserved S2 identity"},{"clause_id":"C34","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"global source delivery"},{"clause_id":"C35","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"exact source contract"},{"clause_id":"C36","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"no value-only replacement"},{"clause_id":"C39","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"source-only classification"},{"clause_id":"C42","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"exact S2 policy row"}]},{"id":"N2","kind":"explicit_non_goal","role":"exclusion","statement":"Runtime campaigns and machine-code, compiler, runtime or physical-resource assurance are excluded. The requested assurance boundary is normative restricted-source execution only, explicitly trusting natural-language correspondence, host tooling, the pinned Lean kernel, hashing and OS/hardware.","required":true,"scope":["assurance boundary"],"dependencies":[],"acceptance_criteria":["No runtime campaign or machine-code, compiler, runtime or physical-resource assurance is included.","The stated trusted components and restricted-source boundary are explicit."],"sources":[{"clause_id":"C30","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"runtime campaigns excluded"},{"clause_id":"C31","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"trusted formal boundary"},{"clause_id":"C32","origin":"explicit","interpretation":"excluded assurance layers"}]}],"category_review":{"entities":"Canonical source artifact, sole typed solve entry, four integer input fields and integer result; normative integer, serialization and string semantics.","preconditions":"A1 is the supplied valid-input schema and bounds; no additional restrictions.","postconditions":"O1 and O2 retain complete universally refined floor-sum behavior and all exact source facets.","invariants":"Input immutability and preservation are retained in source guarantees; no separate loop invariant is specified.","safety_properties":"S1 and S2 retain source-only operational requirements and all seven closed source properties.","liveness_properties":"Typed totality is required within the source guarantees; no separate scheduling requirement.","resource_constraints":"No physical-resource assurance or additional complexity bound is requested.","error_semantics":"Malformed-input behavior is excluded by N1.","explicit_non_goals":"Malformed-input handling, runtime campaigns and assurance outside the restricted-source boundary.","ambiguities":"None; signed floor semantics, empty sum, domain, delivery identity and source facets are specified."},"clauses":[{"clause_id":"C1","disposition":"context","refs":[],"note":"Task title identifies the signed floor-sum kernel."},{"clause_id":"C2","disposition":"obligations","refs":["D1","O2"],"note":""},{"clause_id":"C3","disposition":"obligations","refs":["D1","O2"],"note":""},{"clause_id":"C4","disposition":"obligations","refs":["S1"],"note":""},{"clause_id":"C5","disposition":"obligations","refs":["A1"],"note":""},{"clause_id":"C6","disposition":"exclusion","refs":["N1"],"note":""},{"clause_id":"C7","disposition":"obligations","refs":["D1","A1"],"note":""},{"clause_id":"C8","disposition":"obligations","refs":["O1","O2"],"note":""},{"clause_id":"C9","disposition":"obligations","refs":["O1"],"note":""},{"clause_id":"C10","disposition":"obligations","refs":["O1"],"note":""},{"clause_id":"C11","disposition":"obligations","refs":["S2"],"note":""},{"clause_id":"C12","disposition":"obligations","refs":["D1","O2"],"note":""},{"clause_id":"C13","disposition":"obligations","refs":["O2"],"note":""},{"clause_id":"C14","disposition":"obligations","refs":["O2","S1"],"note":""},{"clause_id":"C15","disposition":"obligations","refs":["O2","S1"],"note":""},{"clause_id":"C16","disposition":"obligations","refs":["D1","O2","S2"],"note":""},{"clause_id":"C17","disposition":"obligations","refs":["D1"],"note":""},{"clause_id":"C18","disposition":"obligations","refs":["A1","O2"],"note":""},{"clause_id":"C19","disposition":"obligations","refs":["O1"],"note":""},{"clause_id":"C20","disposition":"obligations","refs":["O1"],"note":""},{"clause_id":"C21","disposition":"context","refs":[],"note":"Identifies this as a revised canonical restricted-source delivery request."},{"clause_id":"C22","disposition":"obligations","refs":["A1","O1","O2"],"note":"Functional meaning, domain and examples are retained."},{"clause_id":"C23","disposition":"obligations","refs":["D1","N1","O1","O2","A1","S1","S2"],"note":"All listed IDs, roles and required flags are preserved."},{"clause_id":"C24","disposition":"obligations","refs":["D1","O1","O2","S1","S2"],"note":""},{"clause_id":"C25","disposition":"obligations","refs":["O1","O2","S1","S2"],"note":"Delivery requirements retain their requested assurance."},{"clause_id":"C26","disposition":"obligations","refs":["O1","O2"],"note":""},{"clause_id":"C27","disposition":"obligations","refs":["O1","O2"],"note":""},{"clause_id":"C28","disposition":"context","refs":[],"note":"Metadata offsets refer to the revised request."},{"clause_id":"C29","disposition":"obligations","refs":["D1","N1","O1","O2","A1","S1","S2"],"note":"Retains requirement identities and requested Tier 2 restricted_source vscore/0.3 endpoint; no achieved lifecycle state is asserted."},{"clause_id":"C30","disposition":"exclusion","refs":["N2"],"note":""},{"clause_id":"C31","disposition":"exclusion","refs":["N2"],"note":"Records the explicit trust and assurance boundary."},{"clause_id":"C32","disposition":"exclusion","refs":["N2"],"note":""},{"clause_id":"C33","disposition":"context","refs":[],"note":"Source-facet specification is a frozen request constraint, not accepted IR or proof evidence."},{"clause_id":"C34","disposition":"obligations","refs":["O1","O2","S1","S2"],"note":""},{"clause_id":"C35","disposition":"obligations","refs":["O1","O2","S1","S2"],"note":""},{"clause_id":"C36","disposition":"obligations","refs":["O1","O2","S1","S2"],"note":""},{"clause_id":"C37","disposition":"obligations","refs":["O1","O2"],"note":""},{"clause_id":"C38","disposition":"obligations","refs":["O1","O2"],"note":""},{"clause_id":"C39","disposition":"obligations","refs":["S1","S2"],"note":""},{"clause_id":"C40","disposition":"context","refs":[],"note":"Assumptions, exclusions and separate non-vacuity witnesses are outside source-policy rows; no such row is added for them."},{"clause_id":"C41","disposition":"context","refs":[],"note":"Specifies independent supervisor checks before proof, after acceptance and at closure; their success is not asserted."},{"clause_id":"C42","disposition":"obligations","refs":["O1","O2","S1","S2"],"note":"Exact source facets retained; O1/O2 are mixed source/value guarantees and S1/S2 are explicitly source-only."}],"assumptions":[{"id":"A1","supplied_by":"caller or supplied-input provider","discharged_at":"solve invocation by supplying integer fields n,m,a,b with 0<=n<=500 and m>0"}],"ambiguities":[],"selected_defaults":[]}
